{
  "info": {
    "name": "Novacampus — Issue #32 Notifications",
    "description": "Tests du service de notifications multicanal.\n\nBranche : `32-implementer-le-service-de-notifications-mail-push`\n\nEndpoints :\n- GET  /api/notifications         → liste les notifs de l'utilisateur connecté (JWT)\n- PUT  /api/notifications/:id/lire → marque une notif comme lue (JWT)\n- POST /api/notifications/internal → endpoint interne inter-services (no auth)\n\nMail UI (MailHog) : http://localhost:8025\n\nTypes valides : SCHEDULE_CHANGE | PAYMENT_REMINDER | PAYMENT_OVERDUE | ENROLLMENT_REMINDER | INFO",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",        "value": "http://localhost" },
    { "key": "token",           "value": "" },
    { "key": "user_id",         "value": "" },
    { "key": "student_id",      "value": "" },
    { "key": "notification_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 — Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (admin) → stocke token + user_id",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "let body; try { body = pm.response.json(); } catch(e) {}",
                "if (body && body.access_token) {",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.access_token);",
                "  if (body.user && body.user.user_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', body.user.user_id);",
                "  pm.test('Login OK — token stocké', () => pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                "} else {",
                "  pm.test('Login OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                "}"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@novacampus.fr\",\n  \"password\": \"Novacampus2026!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (étudiant) → stocke token + student_id",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.access_token);",
                "  if (body.user) {",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', body.user.id);",
                "    if (body.user.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('student_id', body.user.id);",
                "  }",
                "  pm.test('Login étudiant OK', () => pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                "}"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"etudiant@novacampus.fr\",\n  \"password\": \"Novacampus2026!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 — Endpoint interne (POST /internal)",
      "description": "Endpoint appelé par les autres microservices. Pas de JWT requis.\nSi student_id est vide, la notif ne sera pas créée (null retourné silencieusement).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST internal — par user_id (INFO)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('Statut 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                "let body; try { body = pm.response.json(); } catch(e) {}",
                "if (body && body.notification_id) {",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('notification_id', body.notification_id);",
                "  pm.test('notification_id présent', () => pm.expect(body.notification_id).to.be.a('string'));",
                "  pm.test('read = false par défaut', () => pm.expect(body.read).to.equal(false));",
                "} else {",
                "  pm.test('⚠ Body vide — user_id non renseigné ?', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('user_id')).to.not.be.empty);",
                "}"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"type\": \"INFO\",\n  \"message\": \"Bienvenue sur NovaCampus ! Votre compte est actif.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/notifications/internal"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST internal — par student_id (PAYMENT_REMINDER)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
